---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Proper Facilities Management is a national facilities partner built for restaurant and retail operators who need one point of contact across every location."
  path="/about"
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="on-dark tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">About Proper</span>
      <h1 style="font-size:44px; max-width:700px;">Facilities management, done properly.</h1>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:16px;">We started Proper around a simple idea: multi-location operators don't need another vendor. They need fewer of them, and a partner that treats every location like the one they'd visit themselves.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="on-white">
    <div class="wrap grid-2">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Approach</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px;">One point of contact, every trade, every location</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:0;">
          Operators lose time and money managing a different HVAC company, electrician, and handyman in every market.
          Proper replaces that patchwork with a single relationship: one call, one account manager, one standard of work,
          no matter how many states you're in.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>A vetted network, matched by trade and by location</li>
        <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Work tracked from the first call to job completion</li>
        <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Preventive maintenance built around your brand standards</li>
        <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>A proposal scoped to your locations — never a one-size-fits-all rate card</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="on-cream">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">What We Believe</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Three things we hold to on every job</h2>
      <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:8px;">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Done properly, or not done</h3>
          <p>A quick fix that fails again next month isn't a fix. We track every job to close, not just to dispatch.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>One number to call</h3>
          <p>You shouldn't need a spreadsheet of vendors to keep your locations running. That's our job, not yours.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>No pricing surprises</h3>
          <p>Every proposal is scoped to your actual locations and needs — never a generic rate card.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="on-dark tight">
    <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;">
      <h2 class="section-title">Let's talk about your locations</h2>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:20px;">Request a proposal</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
